---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="After your audit request"
  description="What to expect after submitting a Presence Web Services audit request."
  noindex
>
  <section class="container message-page">
    <h1 data-receipt-heading>After your audit request</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy" data-receipt-copy>
      After your request is successfully submitted, Presence will use the details you shared to
      review your public online presence and respond to your enquiry.
    </p>
    <p>
      The audit is free and carries no obligation. Any paid work will be set out in a separate
      written proposal for you to consider.
    </p>
    <p class="message-note" data-receipt-note>
      Opening this page directly does not submit a request or confirm receipt. Please use the review
      form to send your enquiry.
    </p>
    <Button href="/" variant="secondary">
      Back to the homepage
    </Button>
  </section>
</Layout>
